  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: Here $\\vec{a}+\\vec{b}=\\vec{c} \\& c=a+b$\nNow, $c=\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+2 a b \\cos \\theta}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& (a+b)=\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+2 a b \\cos \\theta} \\\\\n& a^2+b^2+2 a b=a^2+b^2+2 a b \\cos \\theta \\\\\n& \\cos \\theta=1, \\theta=0^{\\circ}\n\\end{aligned}$",
